<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 13,000 T or more of soya pellets.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 13,000 T or more of soya pellets.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has launched a tender for Friday for the purchase of 13,000 tonnes of soya pellets or more for 25-October/5 November shipment, traders said. --Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
